            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 text-accent font-display font-bold mb-4">
                <span class="text-4xl">€ 40</span>
                <span class="font-body font-bold text-xs">/ mes</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-primary/60 mb-6">Plan enfocado a adolescentes: 8 sesiones al mes con acompañamiento especializado.</p>
            <a href="https://taronjamoncada.wodbuster.com/user/pagos.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-auto py-2 bg-accent/10 text-accent font-body font-bold uppercase text-[10px] rounded-lg hover:bg-accent hover:text-white transition-all text-center">Saber más</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BONOS Y SESIONES SECTION -->
    <div class="w-full mb-10 flex flex-col items-start">
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl uppercase text-accent mb-6 text-left relative">
            Bonos y Sesiones
            <span class="absolute -bottom-1.5 left-0 w-10 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full"></span>
        </h3>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full bg-[#f8fafc] border border-primary/5 py-12 px-8 md:px-16 rounded-md overflow-hidden relative group flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 w-full lg:w-3/5 relative z-10">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
